{
  "name": "LevelSoundEventPacket",
  "kind": "packet",
  "id": 123,
  "description": "\n\tMost sounds get launched on server and replicated to clients, but a handful of player initiated sounds are launched on their client and replicated through the network.\n\t(In most of the codebase 'Event' means telemetry events; this is not the case here, this is how sounds get replicated across the network in vanilla.)\n\tWith support for custom entities. Entity Id is a string and Event Id is an integer.\n\t",
